{"seq":4,"slug":"flow-operators","title":"Flow 操作符","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/flow-operators","wordCount":665,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"flow-操作符\">Flow 操作符</h1><p>Kotlin Flow 是基于协程的冷响应式数据流，提供了丰富的操作符来转换、过滤、组合和收集数据。Flow 操作符分为中间操作符（返回新 Flow）和末端操作符（触发实际执行）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Flow 的核心是<strong>冷流</strong>：数据流的构造与执行分离，只有在末端操作符（如 <code>collect</code>）被调用时才真正开始发射。操作符据此分为两类——中间操作符返回新 Flow 且保持惰性，末端操作符触发实际执行并返回结果。组合操作符时的原则是维持懒惰，同时让缓冲与背压可控。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"flow-基础回顾\">Flow 基础回顾</h2><p>Flow 是冷的——只有在末端操作符（如 <code>collect</code>）调用时才开始执行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import kotlinx.coroutines.flow.*&#10;&#10;val numbersFlow: Flow&lt;Int&gt; = flow {&#10;    for (i in 1..5) {&#10;        delay(100)&#10;        emit(i)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlinx.coroutines.flow.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val numbersFlow: Flow&#x3C;Int> = flow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (i in 1..5) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit(i)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[flow builder] --&gt;|emit| B[中间操作符]&#10;    B --&gt;|变换| C[中间操作符]&#10;    C --&gt;|触发| D[末端操作符 collect]\">flowchart LR\n    A[flow builder] --&gt;|emit| B[中间操作符]\n    B --&gt;|变换| C[中间操作符]\n    C --&gt;|触发| D[末端操作符 collect]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"转换操作符\">转换操作符</h2><h3 id=\"map\">map</h3><p>逐个转换每个元素：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"flowOf(1, 2, 3, 4, 5)&#10;    .map { it * it }&#10;    .collect { println(it) } // 1, 4, 9, 16, 25\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>flowOf(1, 2, 3, 4, 5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .map { it * it }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .collect { println(it) } // 1, 4, 9, 16, 25</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"filter\">filter</h3><p>过滤不满足条件的元素：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"flowOf(1, 2, 3, 4, 5)&#10;    .filter { it % 2 == 0 }&#10;    .collect { println(it) } // 2, 4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>flowOf(1, 2, 3, 4, 5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .filter { it % 2 == 0 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .collect { println(it) } // 2, 4</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"transform\">transform</h3><p>最灵活的转换操作符，可以 emit 零个或多个值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"flowOf(&quot;Alice&quot;, &quot;Bob&quot;)&#10;    .transform { name -&gt;&#10;        emit(&quot;$name 登录&quot;)&#10;        emit(&quot;$name 开始操作&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;    .collect { println(it) }&#10;// Alice 登录&#10;// Alice 开始操作&#10;// Bob 登录&#10;// Bob 开始操作\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>flowOf(\"Alice\", \"Bob\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .transform { name -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit(\"$name 登录\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit(\"$name 开始操作\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .collect { println(it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Alice 登录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Alice 开始操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Bob 登录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Bob 开始操作</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作符</th>\n<th>输入 : 输出</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>map</code></td>\n<td>1 : 1</td>\n<td>一对一转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>filter</code></td>\n<td>1 : 0或1</td>\n<td>条件过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transform</code></td>\n<td>1 : N</td>\n<td>灵活转换，可 emit 任意次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mapNotNull</code></td>\n<td>1 : 0或1</td>\n<td>map + 过滤 null</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flatMapConcat</code></td>\n<td>1 : Flow</td>\n<td>顺序展平嵌套 Flow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flatMapMerge</code></td>\n<td>1 : Flow</td>\n<td>并发展平嵌套 Flow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flatMapLatest</code></td>\n<td>1 : Flow</td>\n<td>只保留最新内部 Flow</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"末端操作符\">末端操作符</h2><p>末端操作符是挂起函数，触发 Flow 的实际执行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val numbers = flowOf(1, 2, 3, 4, 5)&#10;&#10;// collect: 收集所有元素&#10;numbers.collect { println(it) }&#10;&#10;// toList: 收集为列表&#10;val list: List&lt;Int&gt; = numbers.toList()&#10;&#10;// first: 获取第一个元素&#10;val first: Int = numbers.first()&#10;&#10;// first { } : 获取第一个满足条件的元素&#10;val firstEven: Int = numbers.first { it % 2 == 0 }&#10;&#10;// reduce: 累积计算&#10;val sum: Int = numbers.reduce { acc, value -&gt; acc + value }&#10;&#10;// fold: 带初始值的累积&#10;val product: Int = numbers.fold(1) { acc, value -&gt; acc * value }&#10;&#10;// count: 计数&#10;val count: Int = numbers.count { it &gt; 3 }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val numbers = flowOf(1, 2, 3, 4, 5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// collect: 收集所有元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>numbers.collect { println(it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// toList: 收集为列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val list: List&#x3C;Int> = numbers.toList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// first: 获取第一个元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val first: Int = numbers.first()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// first { } : 获取第一个满足条件的元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val firstEven: Int = numbers.first { it % 2 == 0 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// reduce: 累积计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val sum: Int = numbers.reduce { acc, value -> acc + value }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// fold: 带初始值的累积</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val product: Int = numbers.fold(1) { acc, value -> acc * value }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// count: 计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val count: Int = numbers.count { it > 3 }</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 末端操作符是挂起函数，会等待 Flow 执行完毕。<code>collect</code> 是最基础的末端操作符。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"flow-组合操作符\">Flow 组合操作符</h2><h3 id=\"zip\">zip</h3><p>将两个 Flow 按索引配对：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val names = flowOf(&quot;Alice&quot;, &quot;Bob&quot;, &quot;Charlie&quot;)&#10;val ages = flowOf(25, 30, 35)&#10;&#10;names.zip(ages) { name, age -&gt; &quot;$name ($age岁)&quot; }&#10;    .collect { println(it) }&#10;// Alice (25岁)&#10;// Bob (30岁)&#10;// Charlie (35岁)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val names = flowOf(\"Alice\", \"Bob\", \"Charlie\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val ages = flowOf(25, 30, 35)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>names.zip(ages) { name, age -> \"$name ($age岁)\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .collect { println(it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Alice (25岁)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Bob (30岁)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Charlie (35岁)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"combine\">combine</h3><p>在任一 Flow 发射新值时，使用两个 Flow 的最新值组合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val flow1 = flow {&#10;    emit(&quot;A&quot;); delay(300)&#10;    emit(&quot;B&quot;); delay(300)&#10;}&#10;val flow2 = flow {&#10;    emit(1); delay(200)&#10;    emit(2); delay(200)&#10;    emit(3)&#10;}&#10;&#10;flow1.combine(flow2) { s, i -&gt; &quot;$s$i&quot; }&#10;    .collect { println(it) }&#10;// A1, A2, B2, B3（取决于时序）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val flow1 = flow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    emit(\"A\"); delay(300)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    emit(\"B\"); delay(300)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val flow2 = flow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    emit(1); delay(200)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    emit(2); delay(200)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    emit(3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>flow1.combine(flow2) { s, i -> \"$s$i\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .collect { println(it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// A1, A2, B2, B3（取决于时序）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"merge\">merge</h3><p>将多个 Flow 合并为一个，按发射顺序交错：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val flow1 = flowOf(1, 2, 3).onEach { delay(100) }&#10;val flow2 = flowOf(10, 20, 30).onEach { delay(150) }&#10;&#10;merge(flow1, flow2)&#10;    .collect { println(it) }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val flow1 = flowOf(1, 2, 3).onEach { delay(100) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val flow2 = flowOf(10, 20, 30).onEach { delay(150) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>merge(flow1, flow2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .collect { println(it) }</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph zip&#10;        A1[Flow A] --&gt;|配对| Z[A+B]&#10;        B1[Flow B] --&gt;|配对| Z&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph combine&#10;        A2[Flow A] --&gt;|最新值| C[A最新+B最新]&#10;        B2[Flow B] --&gt;|最新值| C&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph merge&#10;        A3[Flow A] --&gt;|交错| M[所有值混合]&#10;        B3[Flow B] --&gt;|交错| M&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph zip\n        A1[Flow A] --&gt;|配对| Z[A+B]\n        B1[Flow B] --&gt;|配对| Z\n    end\n\n    subgraph combine\n        A2[Flow A] --&gt;|最新值| C[A最新+B最新]\n        B2[Flow B] --&gt;|最新值| C\n    end\n\n    subgraph merge\n        A3[Flow A] --&gt;|交错| M[所有值混合]\n        B3[Flow B] --&gt;|交错| M\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组合方式</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>输出数量</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>zip</code></td>\n<td>双方都有新值</td>\n<td>min(A, B)</td>\n<td>一一对应配对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>combine</code></td>\n<td>任一方有新值</td>\n<td>取决于时序</td>\n<td>状态组合（UI）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>merge</code></td>\n<td>任一方有新值</td>\n<td>A + B</td>\n<td>事件汇聚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"缓冲与背压\">缓冲与背压</h2><h3 id=\"buffer\">buffer</h3><p>引入缓冲区，让发射和收集并发执行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"flow {&#10;    repeat(3) {&#10;        delay(100) // 生产耗时 100ms&#10;        emit(it)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;.buffer() // 缓冲：生产和消费并发&#10;.collect {&#10;    delay(300) // 消费耗时 300ms&#10;    println(it)&#10;}&#10;// 无 buffer 总耗时约 1200ms，有 buffer 约 1000ms\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>flow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repeat(3) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(100) // 生产耗时 100ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit(it)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.buffer() // 缓冲：生产和消费并发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.collect {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    delay(300) // 消费耗时 300ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(it)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 无 buffer 总耗时约 1200ms，有 buffer 约 1000ms</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"conflate\">conflate</h3><p>丢弃未来得及处理的中间值，只保留最新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"flow {&#10;    repeat(5) {&#10;        emit(it)&#10;        delay(100)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;.conflate()&#10;.collect {&#10;    delay(300)&#10;    println(it) // 可能输出 0, 2, 4（跳过中间值）&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>flow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repeat(5) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit(it)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.conflate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.collect {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    delay(300)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(it) // 可能输出 0, 2, 4（跳过中间值）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"collectlatest\">collectLatest</h3><p>收集最新值，前一个收集未完成时会被取消：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"flow {&#10;    emit(&quot;A&quot;); delay(100)&#10;    emit(&quot;B&quot;); delay(100)&#10;    emit(&quot;C&quot;)&#10;}&#10;.collectLatest { value -&gt;&#10;    println(&quot;开始处理 $value&quot;)&#10;    delay(200)&#10;    println(&quot;完成处理 $value&quot;) // 只有 C 能完成&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>flow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    emit(\"A\"); delay(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    emit(\"B\"); delay(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    emit(\"C\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.collectLatest { value -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(\"开始处理 $value\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    delay(200)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(\"完成处理 $value\") // 只有 C 能完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理\">错误处理</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"flowOf(1, 2, 3)&#10;    .map { check(it != 2) { &quot;不允许2&quot; }; it }&#10;    .catch { e -&gt; emit(-1) } // 捕获上游异常，可恢复&#10;    .onCompletion { cause -&gt;&#10;        if (cause != null) println(&quot;异常完成: $cause&quot;)&#10;        else println(&quot;正常完成&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;    .collect { println(it) }&#10;// 1, -1, 正常完成\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>flowOf(1, 2, 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .map { check(it != 2) { \"不允许2\" }; it }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .catch { e -> emit(-1) } // 捕获上游异常，可恢复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .onCompletion { cause -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (cause != null) println(\"异常完成: $cause\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else println(\"正常完成\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .collect { println(it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 1, -1, 正常完成</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>中间操作符</strong>（map、filter、transform）惰性变换 Flow，不触发执行</li>\n<li><strong>末端操作符</strong>（collect、toList、first、reduce）触发 Flow 实际执行</li>\n<li><strong>zip</strong> 按索引配对两个 Flow，<strong>combine</strong> 基于最新值组合，<strong>merge</strong> 交错合并多个 Flow</li>\n<li><strong>buffer</strong> 引入并发缓冲提升吞吐，<strong>conflate</strong> 丢弃中间值保留最新</li>\n<li><strong>collectLatest</strong> 取消前一个收集处理，只关注最新发射值</li>\n<li><strong>catch</strong> 捕获上游异常并支持恢复，<strong>onCompletion</strong> 在 Flow 结束时执行清理逻辑</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Flow 操作符","id":"flow-操作符"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Flow 基础回顾","id":"flow-基础回顾"},{"level":2,"text":"转换操作符","id":"转换操作符"},{"level":3,"text":"map","id":"map"},{"level":3,"text":"filter","id":"filter"},{"level":3,"text":"transform","id":"transform"},{"level":2,"text":"末端操作符","id":"末端操作符"},{"level":2,"text":"Flow 组合操作符","id":"flow-组合操作符"},{"level":3,"text":"zip","id":"zip"},{"level":3,"text":"combine","id":"combine"},{"level":3,"text":"merge","id":"merge"},{"level":2,"text":"缓冲与背压","id":"缓冲与背压"},{"level":3,"text":"buffer","id":"buffer"},{"level":3,"text":"conflate","id":"conflate"},{"level":3,"text":"collectLatest","id":"collectlatest"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理","id":"错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"通道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/channels"},"next":{"title":"异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/exception-handling"}}